    "name": "Deck Dash",
    "steam_appid": 2829750,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Dash is an asynchronous PvP auto-battler card game. Craft your deck with different types of items, enter fights against other survivors on the island, build your engine on the board, discover countless combos, and defeat your enemies. Epic tactical duels await you on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/7c87e7026eef803e051d9a639270d023.avif?t=1752747780\" data-has-big width=800 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam version of Deck Dash is a PC port of the original mobile game. It is free from the mobile F2P monetization scheme. In this version, you can buy gems only for customization elements, not to progress faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> All your IAP purchases will go to the development of our upcoming titles. Thanks in advance!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Duels</strong> \u2013 Engage in tactical asynchronous PvP battles with your custom deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> \u2013 Personalize your in-game character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranking League</strong> \u2013 Climb the competitive ladder and prove your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions &amp; Events</strong> \u2013 Take on challenges and earn exclusive rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes - </strong>Experience different ways to play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/23c623398daf35cf8fcfc9221722e617.avif?t=1752747780\" data-has-big width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the right combination of items and strategic alignment, anything can happen in Deck Dash. Some engines can create amazing damage and devastate your opponents! Go through many playstyles and find what works best for you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build devastating synergies</strong> that multiply your power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch the numbers explode</strong> as your engine kicks into overdrive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt and counter your opponent\u2019s strategies</strong> in real-time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/c698a52644aaafae686e001b2657e97c.poster.avif?t=1752747780\" width=608 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/c698a52644aaafae686e001b2657e97c.webm?t=1752747780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/c698a52644aaafae686e001b2657e97c.mp4?t=1752747780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/da9eeef6352dea3566972b6b2d2815f6.avif?t=1752747780\" data-has-big width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Dash is designed to have a deep engine-building mechanic that suits an auto-battler card game. With over 150+ unique items, you can mix and match to create the ultimate build. There are no faction restrictions\u2014only pure creativity and strategy.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover countless synergies</strong> and optimize your engine.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt your deck</strong> to counter enemy strategies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experiment with wild mechanics</strong> and find your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/0e34210df1eba72d1c17e49fe17195c3.poster.avif?t=1752747780\" width=608 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/0e34210df1eba72d1c17e49fe17195c3.webm?t=1752747780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/0e34210df1eba72d1c17e49fe17195c3.mp4?t=1752747780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/fa2e3554d60623889e2d26d57f9d92bd.avif?t=1752747780\" data-has-big width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Dash offers a variety of modes designed for infinite replayability, catering to both competitive and casual players. Whether you enjoy testing your skills against others, refining your strategies in PvE, or experimenting with unique deck builds, there\u2019s always a new challenge waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These game modes also serve as testing grounds for shaping the future of Deck Dash. Let us know which modes pique your interest so we can refine the core game with your feedback in mind.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featured Decks</strong> \u2013 Try out curated decks with unique synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All-in Brawl</strong> \u2013 High-risk, high-reward battles with everything on the line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harsh Survival</strong> \u2013 Endurance-based matches that test your adaptability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proving Grounds</strong> \u2013 A true test of skill for seasoned strategists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/8222527ceb0587b863a00d13fb30691b.poster.avif?t=1752747780\" width=608 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/8222527ceb0587b863a00d13fb30691b.webm?t=1752747780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/8222527ceb0587b863a00d13fb30691b.mp4?t=1752747780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deck Dash is an asynchronous PvP auto-battler card game. Craft your deck with different types of items, enter fights against other survivors on the island, build your engine on the board, discover countless combos, and defeat your enemies. Epic tactical duels await you on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/7c87e7026eef803e051d9a639270d023.avif?t=1752747780\" data-has-big width=800 height=396 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam version of Deck Dash is a PC port of the original mobile game. It is free from the mobile F2P monetization scheme. In this version, you can buy gems only for customization elements, not to progress faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> All your IAP purchases will go to the development of our upcoming titles. Thanks in advance!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Duels</strong> \u2013 Engage in tactical asynchronous PvP battles with your custom deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> \u2013 Personalize your in-game character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranking League</strong> \u2013 Climb the competitive ladder and prove your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions &amp; Events</strong> \u2013 Take on challenges and earn exclusive rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes - </strong>Experience different ways to play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829750/extras/23c623398daf35cf8fcfc9221722e617.avif?t=1752747780\" data-has-big width=800 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the right combination of ite